{* ═══════════════════════════════════════════
   模式 2: List+CRUD — 列表 + 搜索 + 筛选 + 模态框

   覆盖页面: 广告活动·Offer·流量源·广告网络·自动规则 (70% SaaS)
   组件树:
     L5 Page → L4 Template (main.latte) → L3 Organism (list-crud)
       ├── L2: search-group, filter-group, data-table
       ├── L1: button, input, badge
       └── 五态: loading→empty→error→data→filtered

   使用示例 (PHP 控制器):
     LatteEngine::display('patterns/list-crud-page', [
       'crudId' => 'campaigns',
       'title' => '广告管理',
       'baseUrl' => '/campaigns.php',
       'columns' => [['key'=>'id','label'=>'ID','sortable'=>true],
                     ['key'=>'name','label'=>'名称','sortable'=>true]],
       'items' => $campaigns,
       'filters' => [['value'=>'all','label'=>'全部'],
                     ['value'=>'active','label'=>'运行中']],
       'formFields' => '<label>名称<input name="name"></label>',
     ]);
   ═══════════════════════════════════════════ *}

{layout '../_layouts/main.latte'}

{block content}
  {* 直接嵌入 L3 生物体 — 所有 CRUD 逻辑由 list_crud_controller.js 处理 *}
  {include '../organisms/list-crud.latte',
    crudId: ($crudId ?? 'crud'),
    title: ($title ?? '列表'),
    createLabel: ($createLabel ?? '+ 新建'),
    baseUrl: ($baseUrl ?? '#'),
    columns: ($columns ?? []),
    items: ($items ?? []),
    filters: ($filters ?? []),
    rowActions: ($rowActions ?? []),
    emptyIcon: ($emptyIcon ?? '📋'),
    emptyTitle: ($emptyTitle ?? '还没有数据'),
    emptyDesc: ($emptyDesc ?? '创建第一条记录开始使用'),
    searchPlaceholder: ($searchPlaceholder ?? '搜索...'),
    formFields: ($formFields ?? '')}
{/block}
